    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 93,
        "text": "The club meeting is on Friday. Can we prepare a digital document with the agenda today?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8f8f2b1d69ba51c5e2ada48746076fa260356d202097844d4ffd477ed040a06c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 100,
        "sourceEnd": 234,
        "text": "Yes. First, let's connect the laptop to the wireless network. The internet is working, and I can open the club website in the browser.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "90ec889a45fc969c611c220a47ad77ad34934ebc14fdcd1a45d730e301fd6905",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 241,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "Is this our real account? I do not want to use my usual password during a lesson.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a62d742c563c9f689b8f8f57c2c1e2ed3e8ffa0697ee8c13dc4daad6420f4f5f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 329,
        "sourceEnd": 486,
        "text": "No, this is a practice account. The username is printed on the lesson card, and the password is on a separate card. We will remove both cards after practice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9fde7c27c753f4ea75d51e4b43295d9cb0d36b4aec791220cbef844c4a65a688",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 493,
        "sourceEnd": 591,
        "text": "I can type with the keyboard, but the mouse is not moving the pointer. Is that a hardware problem?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "60de842ba82b022faaa6ba849c995ef19117314d7f7ba89ed4eb75cc52910025",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 598,
        "sourceEnd": 727,
        "text": "Maybe. Press this small button underneath it first. If the mouse is switched off, the pointer does not move. There, it works now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "fe703358451623702142833736d6858043c1ba23571e5ec1e6e6186ed37eeadf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 734,
        "sourceEnd": 819,
        "text": "Good. After the login screen, I see a folder called Events. Which file should I open?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "64f0a9899bfa9fd7a562b83ac9eb33de7bab213eb42ac28416142952acbf99e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 826,
        "sourceEnd": 971,
        "text": "Open the one called Agenda Practice. Then add Friday's start time, which is six thirty. Before you save it, check that the room is number twelve.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "da600367f66371815daa85ef069376328ad03fb4fb8cc3ebef1eeecfcfead322",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 978,
        "sourceEnd": 1060,
        "text": "Done. I will save a copy on the device. Should I upload it to the shared area now?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "012e24c0b69fbca3022b59b85c161990fb552c90d1d105322b7560eb6e8f025f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 1067,
        "sourceEnd": 1188,
        "text": "Yes, but use the practice area, not the real members' area. After you upload it, check that its name appears on the page.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d94366b79e51e65cfa9d67d70130217b14ef8edfac5dab695c93eef9e862b520",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1195,
        "sourceEnd": 1311,
        "text": "I can see it. Can I download the blank form as well? I want offline access when I am traveling without a connection.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3107dc3d3de9740703ced205d6af53d33dae15344542a55d14e0795ae17f4fc2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 1318,
        "sourceEnd": 1439,
        "text": "Of course. You do not need to install any new software for this form. The center staff update the program when necessary.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "072f7496cdb31a7005d35aa5a75b1c3b08b1a5c003d4a463d92b917fc953614e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1446,
        "sourceEnd": 1487,
        "text": "Should I send an email to the club today?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5b2830d8b559d06d00ac17446ae5f72bcfea48462dad7fcc33d7cd8b105db733",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "june",
        "speaker": "June",
        "sourceStart": 1494,
        "sourceEnd": 1664,
        "text": "Wait until we check the real agenda tomorrow. For now, use the logout button before leaving the computer. Online notes can be useful, but we need to check them carefully.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4f6d6d89d081075944306c8e6686e3ea0436fb3f738cd8bb3b3bd31a60502464",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "omar",
        "speaker": "Omar",
        "sourceStart": 1671,
        "sourceEnd": 1745,
        "text": "Thanks. This technology is less confusing when we take one step at a time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5e9b895b4bfde526eebcc57799204a447d2cdf432724127d933ec26ad4e7237b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
